# This chart renders Applications only — the component directories under components/ are
# pointed AT by those Applications (via path), never packaged into this chart. Anything in
# them that is not a values file is dead weight here, and Helm refuses outright to package
# a file over 5 MiB.
#
# components/*/image/ holds container build context: Dockerfiles, and build output that can
# run to hundreds of MiB. Without this, `helm template platform platform` fails with
#   Error: chart file "dread-server.zip" is larger than the maximum file size 5242880
#
# Helm's ignore syntax has no double-star: a trailing-slash pattern matches the directory
# and everything under it, which is what is wanted here.
components/*/image/

.git/
.gitignore
*.tmp
